five turnaround views in a horizontal strip across the top, left-aligned starting at the left edge — front view, left side, three-quarter view, right side, back view, each 200 pixels wide, 480 pixels tall keep the entire subject inside its own cell with equal empty margin on all four sides, never letting limbs, weapons, or effects cross into a neighbouring cell; render every cell at an identical bounding box and identical pixel scale; cells are separated by background only — no drawn cell borders, dividing lines, gridlines, or gutters; no text, labels, captions, numbers, or watermarks anywhere on the sheet. three facial expression close-ups side by side, left-aligned starting at the left edge — neutral, happy, angry — each 256 pixels wide, 192 pixels tall. a horizontal palette swatch row showing all colours used, 1024 pixels wide, 128 pixels tall. two detail callout panels side by side, each 512 pixels wide, 320 pixels tall. one outfit-variant panel, 256 pixels wide, 384 pixels tall, showing an alternate outfit or colour scheme. White background, consistent scale across all views. Professional sprite sheet format
